    notes: >-
      The inference engine this server drives (piqtree 0.8 builds IQ-TREE 3
      into its wheel), and academic software that expects to be cited. This is
      the general IQ-TREE 3 citation given at iqtree.org; cite it — and the
      substitution-model selection or bootstrap method actually used, as
      listed there — for any published result. Citing the wrapper does not
      discharge that.
